@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Account — Register a Member
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

start
|Guest|
:Choose Register / Become a Member;
:Provide email, phone and authentication information;
:Submit registration form;
|System|
:Validate required fields and account rules;
if (Input valid and account can be created?) then (yes)
  :Create Member account;
  :Create authenticated Member session;
  :Record technical audit event;
  |Member|
  :See successful registration;
  :Continue to homepage or the protected action\nthat initiated registration;
else (no)
  :Show validation or account-creation error;
  |Guest|
  :Correct or abandon registration;
endif

note right
Identity proofing, password policy, recovery and session implementation are not approved yet.
This diagram records the required business outcome, not a final technical design.
end note
stop
@enduml
